          Our compressor uses smart algorithms to maintain the best possible quality while reducing
          file size. For passport photos and forms, the quality reduction is minimal.
        </p>

        <h3>What format should I use?</h3>
        <p>
          Always use JPG/JPEG format. It's accepted by all government portals and provides the
          best balance of quality and file size.
